@model MyVoltage.Models.OperationalModels.A02_MirrorMeterAuditing.A02_MirrorMeterAuditing_MeterCalibrationDetailModel
@inject MyVoltage.Services.OperationalProvider operationalProvider;
@using MyVoltage.Extensions;
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = $"{MyVoltage.Data.SecureAreaEnum.A02_MirrorMeterAuditing_MeterCalibrationDetails.GetDescription()} - {operationalProvider.CompanyName}";
}

<div class="row mb-4">
    <div class="col">

        <div class="card p-md-1 mv-gradient">
            <div class="card-header text-left">
                <a href="/operational/A02_MirrorMeterAuditing/A02_MirrorMeterAuditing_MeterCalibrationSummary" class="btn btn-outline-primary-sm"><i class="fas fa-chevron-left"></i>&nbsp;Back</a>
                &nbsp;(Tip: Use Ctrl + F to search)
            </div>
            <div class="card-body">
                @if (operationalProvider.CompanyID == 0)
                {
                    <span>Please select a company from the sidebar to see results.</span>
                }
                else
                {
                    if (Model.TotalEntries == 0)
                    {
                        <span>There are no outstanding entries for @operationalProvider.CompanyName</span>
                    }
                    else
                    {
                        <table class="table table-sm table-striped table-hover table-bordered">
                            <thead>
                                <tr>
                                    <th scope="col">Customer Number</th>
                                    <th scope="col">Meter Name</th>
                                    <th scope="col">Meter Serial</th>
                                    <th scope="col">Audit Reading</th>
                                    <th scope="col">Audit Time</th>
                                    <th scope="col">System Reading</th>
                                    <th scope="col">Calculated Difference</th>
                                    <th scope="col">Calibration Date</th>
                                    <th scope="col">Calibration Status</th>
                                    <th scope="col">Expiry Date</th>
                                </tr>
                            </thead>
                            <tbody>
                                @foreach (var itemC in Model.A02_MirrorMeterAuditing_MeterCalibrationDetailItems)
                                {
                                    <tr style="cursor:pointer;" title="View @itemC.CustomerNo" onclick="RedirectToVerification('@itemC.CustomerMeterSerial', '@((itemC.Status == MyVoltage.Data.A02_MirrorMeterAuditing_MeterCalibrationVerification.StatusTypes.None).ToString().ToLower())');">
                                        <td scope="col">@itemC.CustomerNo</td>
                                        <td scope="col">@itemC.CustomerMeterName</td>
                                        <td scope="col">@itemC.CustomerMeterSerial</td>
                                        <td scope="col" class="text-right"><div id="latestReadingOdo_@itemC.MirrorDeviceID"><i class="fas fa-spinner"></i></div></td>
                                        <td scope="col" class="text-right"><div id="latestReadingOdoTime_@itemC.MirrorDeviceID"><i class="fas fa-spinner"></i></div></td>
                                        <td scope="col" class="text-right"><div id="verificationReading_@itemC.MirrorDeviceID"><i class="fas fa-spinner"></i></div></td>
                                        <td scope="col" class="text-right"><div id="calculatedDifferenceReading_@itemC.MirrorDeviceID"><i class="fas fa-spinner"></i></div></td>
                                        <td scope="col">@(itemC.CalibrationDate.ToDateAndTimeShort())</td>
                                        <td scope="col">@itemC.Status</td>
                                        <td scope="col">@itemC.ExpiryDate.ToDateAndTimeShort(true)</td>
                                    </tr>
                                }
                            </tbody>
                        </table>
                    }
                }
            </div>

            <div class="card-footer">
                @if (true@* Model.TotalEntries > Model.EntriesPerPage *@)
                {
                    var prevDisabled = !Model.A02_MirrorMeterAuditing_MeterCalibrationDetailItems.HasPreviousPage ? "disabled" : "";
                    var nextDisabled = !Model.A02_MirrorMeterAuditing_MeterCalibrationDetailItems.HasNextPage ? "disabled" : "";
                    <div class="row mt-2">
                        <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between pager_btns mt-15">
                            <div class="col-md-auto text-left">
                                <a href="#" onclick="RedirectToFilter(@(Model.A02_MirrorMeterAuditing_MeterCalibrationDetailItems.PageIndex - 1));"
                                   class="btn btn-outline-primary-sm @prevDisabled">
                                    <i class="fas fa-step-backward"></i>&nbsp;Previous Page
                                </a>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col text-center">
                            @for (int pageNumber = 1; pageNumber <= Model.A02_MirrorMeterAuditing_MeterCalibrationDetailItems.TotalPages; pageNumber++)
                            {
                                var numberDisabled = Model.A02_MirrorMeterAuditing_MeterCalibrationDetailItems.PageIndex == pageNumber ? "btn-outline-warning disabled" : "btn-outline-primary-sm";
                                <a href="#" onclick="RedirectToFilter(@(pageNumber));"
                                   class="btn btn-sm @numberDisabled">
                                    @pageNumber
                                </a>
                            }
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-auto">
                            <select id="EntriesPerPage" class="form-control" onchange="RedirectToFilter(@(Model.A02_MirrorMeterAuditing_MeterCalibrationDetailItems.PageIndex));">
                                @if (Model.EntriesPerPage == 100)
                                {
                                    <option value="100" selected="selected">100</option>
                                }
                                else
                                {
                                    <option value="100">100</option>
                                }
                                @if (Model.EntriesPerPage == 500)
                                {
                                    <option value="500" selected="selected">500</option>
                                }
                                else
                                {
                                    <option value="500">500</option>
                                }
                                @if (Model.EntriesPerPage == 1000)
                                {
                                    <option value="1000" selected="selected">1000</option>
                                }
                                else
                                {
                                    <option value="1000">1000</option>
                                }
                                @if (Model.EntriesPerPage == Model.TotalEntries)
                                {
                                    <option value="@Model.TotalEntries" selected="selected">All (@(Model.TotalEntries))</option>
                                }
                                else
                                {
                                    <option value="@Model.TotalEntries">All (@(Model.TotalEntries))</option>
                                }
                            </select>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-auto text-right">
                            <a align="left" href="#" onchange="RedirectToFilter(@(Model.A02_MirrorMeterAuditing_MeterCalibrationDetailItems.PageIndex + 1));"
                               class="btn btn-outline-primary-sm @nextDisabled">
                                <i class="fas fa-step-forward"></i>&nbsp;Next Page
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                }

            </div>

        </div>

    </div>
</div>

@section Scripts {
    <script>
        function RedirectToFilter(pageIndex) {
            document.location.href = window.location.href.split('?')[0] + '?EntriesPerPage=' + $("#EntriesPerPage").val() + '&pageIndex=' + pageIndex;
        }
        function RedirectToVerification(serial, showAlert) {
            if (showAlert == "true") {
                alert('The meter you are trying to view cannot be calibrated until the Scheduled Creation Run has completed.');
            }
            document.location.href = '/operational/changeActiveMeter/' + serial + '?R=/operational/A02_MirrorMeterAuditing/A02_MirrorMeterAuditing_MeterCalibrationVerification';
        }
        $(document).ready(function () {
            $("#latestBillingSync").load('@Url.Content("/operational/shared/billingsync/latestbillingsynccompany")');
        });
        var companies = @(Html.Raw(Newtonsoft.Json.JsonConvert.SerializeObject(Model.A02_MirrorMeterAuditing_MeterCalibrationDetailItems.Select(p => p.MirrorDeviceID).ToList())));
        $(companies).each(function () {
            PopulateLabelsForUpdate(this);
        });
        function PopulateLabelsForUpdate(itemID) {
            $.post('/operational/A02_MirrorMeterAuditing/A02_MirrorMeterAuditing_MeterCalibration_GetMirrorReading',
                {
                    deviceid: itemID,
                })
                .done(function (data) {
                    $("#latestReadingOdo_" + itemID).html(data.latestReadingOdo);
                    $("#latestReadingOdoTime_" + itemID).html(data.latestReadingOdoTime);
                    $("#verificationReading_" + itemID).html(data.verificationReading);
                    $("#calculatedDifferenceReading_" + itemID).html(data.calculatedDifferenceReading);
                });
        }
    </script>
}
